+// sketch-orca oracle patch 0005 (2026-11-06): the dump knob (OracleDump.hpp). The files are SOP1
+// containers, version 1, as parity/SOP1.md in sketch-orca specifies them: the magic "SOP1", a u32
+// version, then records (a four-letter kind, a u64 payload length, the payload) and an END record.
+// Every value is little-endian; floats are written as their exact bit patterns. The record kinds
+// written here (HEAD, RUN, CONF, MODL, OBJ, LAYR, SUPL, PRNT, TOOL, WIPE, STAT, CNFL, END) and their
+// payloads are listed there field by field, in the order this file writes them.
